<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>회원가입 완료</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">

    <style>

        body{
            background:#f5f6fa;
            font-family:'맑은 고딕', sans-serif;
        }

        .complete-box{
            width:500px;
            margin:100px auto;
            background:white;
            padding:50px;
            border-radius:20px;
            box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align:center;
        }

        .icon{
            font-size:60px;
        }

        .title{
            font-size:40px;
            font-weight:bold;
            margin-top:20px;
            color:#333;
        }

        .msg{
            margin-top:30px;
            font-size:20px;
            color:#666;
        }

        .login-btn{
            display:inline-block;
            margin-top:40px;
            background:#ff6b6b;
            color:white;
            text-decoration:none;
            padding:15px 40px;
            border-radius:12px;
            font-size:20px;
            transition:0.3s;
        }

        .login-btn:hover{
            background:#ff5252;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="complete-box">

    <div class="icon">
        🎉
    </div>

    <div class="title">
        회원가입 완료
    </div>

    <div class="msg">
        회원가입이 정상적으로 완료되었습니다.<br>
        로그인 후 과일 쇼핑몰을 이용해보세요!
    </div>

    <a href="/user/login" class="login-btn">
        로그인 하러가기
    </a>

</div>

</body>
</html>